{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_qct_13_1","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"符言第十二","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_2","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"發言必驗，有若符契。故曰：符言。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_3","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"安徐正靜，其被節無不肉。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_4","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"被，及也。肉，肥也。謂饒裕也。言人若居位能安徐正靜，則所及人節度，無不饒裕。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_5","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"善與而不靜，虛心平意，以待傾損。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_6","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"言人君善與事結，而不安靜者，但虛心平意以待之，傾損之期必至矣。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_7","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主位。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_8","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於位者，安徐正靜而已。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_9","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"目貴明，耳貴聰，心貴智。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_10","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"目明則視無不見，耳聰則聽無不聞，心智則思無不通。是三者無擁，則何措而非當也。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_11","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"以天下之目視者，則無不見；以天下之耳聽者，則無不聞；以天下之心慮者，則無不知。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_12","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"昔在帝堯，聰明文思，光宅天下，蓋用此道也。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_13","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"輻湊並進，則明不可塞。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_14","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"夫聖人不自用其聰明思慮，而任之天下，故明者為之視，聰者為之聽，智者為之謀。若雲從龍，風從虎，霈然而莫之禦，輻湊並進，不亦宜乎！若日月照臨，其可塞哉！故曰：明不可塞也。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_15","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主明。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_16","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於明者，以天下之目視也。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_17","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"德之術，曰：勿堅而拒之。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_18","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"崇德之術，在於恢弘博納。山不讓塵，故能成其高；海不辭流，故能成其深；聖人不拒眾，故能成其大。故曰：勿堅而拒之也。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_19","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"許之則防守，拒之則閉塞。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_20","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"言許而容之，眾必歸而防守；拒而逆之，眾必違而閉塞。歸而防守，則危可安；違而閉塞，則通更壅。夫崇德者，安可以不弘納哉！","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_21","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"高山仰之可極，深淵度之可測。神明之位術正靜，其莫之極歟！","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_22","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"高莫過山猶可極，深莫過淵猶可測，若乃神明之位，德術正靜，迎之不見其前，隨之不見其後，其可測量乎哉。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_23","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主德。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_24","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於德者，在於含弘而勿距也。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_25","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"用賞貴信，用刑貴正。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_26","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"賞信則立功之士，致命捐生；刑正則受戮之人，沒齒無怨也。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_27","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"賞賜貴信，必驗耳目之所見聞；其所不見聞者，莫不闇化矣。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_28","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"言施恩行賞，耳目所見聞，則能驗察不謬，動必當功，如此則信在言前，雖不見聞者，莫不闇化也。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_29","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"誠，暢於天下神明，而況姦者幹君。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_30","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"言每賞從信，則至誠暢於天下。神明保之，如赤子天祿，不傾如泰山，又況不逞之徒，欲奮其姦謀，幹於君位者哉！此猶腐肉之齒，利劍鋒接，必無事矣。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_31","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主賞。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_32","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於賞者，貴於信也。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_33","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"一曰天之，二曰地之，三曰人之。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_34","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"天有逆順之紀，地有孤虛之理，人有通塞之分。有天下者，宜皆知之。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_35","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"四方上下，左右前後，熒[火惑]之處安在！","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_36","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"夫四方上下，左右前後，有陰陽向背之宜，有國從事者，不可不知，又螢[火惑]，天之法星，所居災眚，吉兇尤著。故曰：雖有明天子，必察熒[火惑]之所在，故亦須知也。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_37","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主問。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_38","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於問者，須辨三才之道。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_39","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"心為九竅之治，君為五官之長。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_40","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"九竅運為，心之所使；五官動作，君之所命。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_41","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"為善者，君與之賞；為非者，君與之罰。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_42","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"賞善罪非，為政之大經也。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_43","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"君因其政之所以求因與之，則不勞。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_44","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"與者應彼所求，求者應而無得，應求則取施不妄得應，則行之無怠。循性而動，何勞之有？","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_45","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"聖人用之，故能賞之；因之循理，固能久長。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_46","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"因求而與，悅莫大焉！雖無玉帛，勸同賞矣！然因逆理，禍莫速焉！因之循理，固能長久者也。","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_47","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主因。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_48","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於因者，貴於循理。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_49","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"人主不可不周，人主不周，則群臣生亂。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_50","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"周謂遍知物理，於理不周，故群臣亂也。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_51","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"家於其無常也。內外不通，安知所開。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_52","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"家，猶業也。群臣既亂，故所業者無常，而內外閉塞，觸途多礙，何如知所開乎！","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_53","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"開閉不善，不見原也。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_54","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"開閉，即捭闔也。既不用捭闔之理，不見為善之源也。","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_55","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主周。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_56","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於周者，在於遍知物理。","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_57","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"一曰長目，二曰飛耳，三曰樹明。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_58","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"用天下之目視，故曰：長視。用天下之耳聽，故曰：飛耳。用天下之心慮，故曰：樹明者也。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_59","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"千里之外，隱微之中，是謂洞天下。姦莫不闇變更。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_60","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"言用天下之心慮，則無不知。故千里之外，隱微之中，莫不玄覽。既察隱微，故為姦之徒，絕邪於心胸，故曰：莫不闇變更也。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_61","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主恭。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_62","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於恭者，在於聰明文思。","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_63","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"循名而為，實安而完。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_64","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"實既副名，所以安全。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_65","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"名實相生，反相為情。","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_66","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"循名而為實，因實而生名，名實不虧，則情在其中。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_67","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"故曰：名當則生於實，實立自生於理。","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_68","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"名當自生於實，實立自生於理。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_69","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"理生於名實之德，","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_70","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"無理不當，則名實之德自生也。","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_71","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"德生於和，和生於當。","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_72","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有德必和，能和自當。","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_73","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"有主名。","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_qct_13_74","chapterId":"ch_work_qct_13","text":"主於名者，在於稱實。","sortOrder":74}],"overrides":{}}